{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2013-11", "window": 2, "start_date": 1383868800, "end_date": 1384559999, "month_true_total": 808, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:50:43 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "7665190", "author": {"steamid": "76561198038149600", "personaname": "RASH", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/RASH2CHAOS/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 223486, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 122, "playtime_at_review": 762, "last_played": 1789408017, "avatar": "2920fd87503dfb7923fb27256fde606ba6b90cdb"}, "language": "english", "review": "rubedo", "timestamp_created": 1384546704, "timestamp_updated": 1602367491, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "7664807", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042367538", "personaname": "Abureaucrat", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Abureaucrat/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 87, "playtime_forever": 118983, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 45967, "last_played": 1774581831, "avatar": "31234f52d8479632d7a0ea38aa124f9c2e376c26"}, "language": "english", "review": "Quick gunplay meets fun and fast slash and dash action. \n\nIt is completely free to play with only one true end-game: Fashionframe.\nYou need some Plat for that, but lucky you rare bits, pieces, and blueprints can be traded for tidy sums of that cosmetically-essential pay currency.\nEverything else you need is basically a grindfest to get, but a solid core gameplay loop (\"be fast and deadly\") helps keep the monotony at bay.\n\nIt can be played in solo sessions or with up to four person co-op (in case your internet proves to be a problem, you can limit said problem by playing solo).\nBetter know what you're doing though, there is little love for a lone Tenno.\nThe constant and thriving playerbase also means you rarely will find yourself without SOME help.\n\nOverall I would still say it's a fun game that is worth the price of $20+ provided completely for free.", "timestamp_created": 1384543825, "timestamp_updated": 1587186456, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "7660006", "author": {"steamid": "76561198066526754", "personaname": "Ephyra", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ephyral/", "num_games_owned": 204, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 24204, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 23813, "last_played": 1515332004, "avatar": "d6693d1d663ce881cd101c21d2eac5b112db1b78"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great fun for those who are looking for more co-op oriented fps with unique abilities thrown in. Those who are looking for pvp content would be better off waiting until conclave in this game is further updated tho, there's a lack of players in conclave. \n\nNominated for labor of love award from a founder.", "timestamp_created": 1384490766, "timestamp_updated": 1511430028, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "7659773", "author": {"steamid": "76561198083375118", "personaname": "coltrain12000", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198083375118/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 151614, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11164, "last_played": 1777522781, "avatar": "493d003d377c4efcdca2d4d5aad4a542db792bc6"}, "language": "english", "review": "must try", "timestamp_created": 1384487536, "timestamp_updated": 1384487536, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "7659727", "author": {"steamid": "76561197969541921", "personaname": "Tact", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197969541921/", "num_games_owned": 333, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 121219, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 775, "last_played": 1735625672, "avatar": "c82bfe43267bbbe9ce16bf6012cd7d95c89b576a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Gonna leave my original 2013 review in here.\n\nNovember 2013 review:\nSTAY AWAY FROM THIS GAME. It is the most boring, tedious grinding game ever. Just a generic hamster wheel with a hole for your money.\n\nApril 2016 Review:\nGenerally good experience. Story added, progression, regular drops, grind is fun, crafting system rewarding... big improvement from 2013 lol.\n\n2019 Review:\nGame has improved, community really helpful, Enjoyed it enough to give them some money.... :)\n\n2022 Review:\nAside from Woke story telling (puke), the game is great. I've got over 1200 hours logged... :D", "timestamp_created": 1384487048, "timestamp_updated": 1654952882, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.492632389068603516", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_